  "metaDescription": "Bareskrim Polri questioned Budi Arie regarding an alleged treason case involving Listyo Sigit, while former aides to Jokowi missed their scheduled session.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Budi Arie underwent nine hours of questioning by Bareskrim Polri regarding his alleged links to a treason case against President Prabowo.",
    "Budi Arie stated he does not know the suspects in the case, with the exception of Listyo Sigit, and denied his comments on 2029 elections constitute treason.",
