  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Bareskrim Polri is currently conducting an investigation into an alleged treason plot targeting President Prabowo, which involves a group led by Listyo Sigit. As part of these inquiries, authorities summoned Budi Arie, the chairman of the Projo organization and former Minister of Cooperatives and Information, for a nine-hour questioning session. During the examination, Budi Arie clarified his position, asserting that he lacks personal acquaintance with the identified suspects, save for Listyo Sigit. Additionally, he refuted claims that his public remarks concerning the potential acceleration of the 2029 elections were related to any treasonous activities. Meanwhile, the investigation faces logistical hurdles, as other individuals summoned by the police, including a former aide to former President Jokowi, did not appear for their scheduled appointments and will be rescheduled for the following week.",
